# Copy this file to .env and fill in your real key. .env is gitignored —
# never commit your actual key.
#
# This key ships inside the built client JS bundle (there's no backend on a
# static site to hide it behind), so before deploying:
#   1. In the OpenRouter dashboard, set a hard monthly spend limit on this key.
#   2. Restrict it to only work from your site's origin (rashidh.com).
# That caps the damage if it's ever scraped from the deployed bundle.
PUBLIC_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
